"imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 32, "prompt": "During his assessment of the patient's knee, Chris decided that\nA. her body type wasn't naturally suited to her sport.\nB. the pain she felt was mainly located in one place.\nC. some key muscles weren't strong enough.", "sourcePage": 70, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 33, "prompt": "In the first stage of his treatment, Chris\nA. was careful to explain his methods in detail.\nB. soon discovered what was causing the problem.\nC. used evidence from MRI scans to inform his approach.", "sourcePage": 70, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 34, "prompt": "Why did Chris decide against the practice known as 'taping'?\nA. The patient was reluctant to use it.\nB. It might give a false sense of security.\nC. The treatment was succeeding without it.", "sourcePage": 70, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 35, "prompt": "In the patient's gym work, Chris's main concern was to ensure that she\nA. tried out a wide range of fitness exercises.\nB. focussed on applying the correct techniques.\nC. was capable of managing her own training regime.", "sourcePage": 71, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 36, "prompt": "Why was the patient's run-up technique changed?\nA. to enable her to gain more speed before take off\nB. to reduce the stress placed on her take-off leg\nC. to reinforce the break from her old mindset\nNow look at extract two.\nExtract 2: Questions 37-42\nYou hear a clinical psychiatrist called Dr Anthony Gibbens giving a presentation about the value\nof individual patients' experiences and 'stories' in medicine.\nYou now have 90 seconds to read questions 37-42.", "sourcePage": 71, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 37, "prompt": "What impressed Dr Gibbens about the case study that was sent to him?\nA. where it was originally published\nB. how controversial its contents were\nC. his colleague's reasons for sending it to him", "sourcePage": 71, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 38, "prompt": "Dr Gibbens has noticed that people who read his books\nA. gain insights into their mental health problems.\nB. see an improvement in personal relationships.\nC. benefit from a subtle change in behaviour.", "sourcePage": 71, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 39, "prompt": "What disadvantage of doctors using patients' stories does Dr Gibbens identify?\nA. evidence-based research being disregarded\nB. patients being encouraged to self-diagnose\nC. a tendency to jump to conclusions", "sourcePage": 72, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 40, "prompt": "In Dr Gibbens' opinion, why should patients' stories inform medical practice?\nA. They provide an insight not gained from numbers alone.\nB. They prove useful when testing new theories.\nC. They are more accessible than statistics.", "sourcePage": 72, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 41, "prompt": "How does Dr Gibbens feel about randomised medical trials?\nA. He questions the reliability of the method.\nB. He is suspicious of the way data are selected for them.\nC. He is doubtful of their value when used independently.", "sourcePage": 72, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 42, "prompt": "When talking about the use of narratives in medicine in the future, Dr Gibbens\nreveals\nA. his determination that they should be used to inform research.\nB. his commitment to making them more widely accepted.\nC. his optimism that they will be published more widely.\nYou now have two minutes to check your answers.\nEND OF THE LISTENING TEST", "sourcePage": 72, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 75, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["51e46fe4ccfd58376a22d6ea45f0929a0659d93277ec1ef578566fe24bd79c79"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
